  { number := 108, text := "3. In running prose, dates MAY use `YYYYMMDD` or `YYYY-MM-DD`. A single spec SHOULD pick one prose form and keep it consistent." },
  { number := 109, text := "4. Specs SHALL NOT invent a fake history of shipped 0.x releases for work that was never published. First publication of a specification SHALL be version 1.0.0. Changelog entries SHOULD use real SemVer headings once versions are assigned; they SHALL NOT label intermediate snapshots as shipped version numbers that were never released." },
